{"id":"corta","lemma":"corta","pos":"noun","rank":1367,"glosses":["cutting (of trees)"],"ipa":"/ˈkoɾta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cortas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-corta.wav","examples":[{"text":"La vida es corta.","en":"Life's short.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438310"},{"text":"Tengo las uñas demasiado cortas.","en":"My nails are too short.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637227"},{"text":"¿Quién corta el pan?","en":"Who cut the bread?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/410101"},{"text":"A ella le gustan las faldas cortas.","en":"She likes short skirts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461424"},{"text":"Ese cuchillo corta bien.","en":"That knife cuts well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/42243"}]}